{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>turned white.</b> Its meaning: it turned to white." "<b>deeper.</b> Its depth is more than the depth of the skin, and it is not like [something] low." "<b>and he shall declare him impure.</b> By speech, that he say he is impure." "<b>and the priest shall isolate the lesion for seven days.</b> The person shall be isolated, and he shall wait until seven days, for most illnesses change on the seventh day."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:09:44.619679970Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}